  "title": "wsutil: Modernize rsa_decrypt_inplace",
  "description": "For a very long time libgcrypt has supported passing a flags parameter\nthat will cause it to remove the padding; use that instead of manually\nremoving PKCS#1 v1.5 padding. (libgcrypt also supports removing OAEP\npadding, which should be added as an option._ This also changes the\nreturn S-Expression in a way that makes it somewhat faster to copy out.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
